                                                      "subject": "Diferencia fundamental entre Adjetivo (describe cosas/personas) y Adverbio de Modo (describe acciones).",
                                                      "formula": "[ He is a quick runner ] ➔ [ He runs quickly ]",
                                                      "example": "Sofia is a fluent speaker. She speaks English fluently with her exchange classmates.",
                                                      "exampleEs": "El adjetivo acompaña al sustantivo ('fluent speaker'); el adverbio modifica al verbo ('speaks fluently').",
