                      "label": "4. Pedir Direcciones con Cortesía (? Excuse me)",
                      "subject": "Excuse me, where is the nearest...?",
                      "rule": "Excuse me, where is + [Lugar]? ➔ It's on [Calle] / next to [Lugar]",
                      "formula": "[ Excuse me, where is the nearest pharmacy? ]",
                      "example": "Excuse me, where is the nearest pharmacy? - It's on the corner of 5th Avenue!",
                      "exampleEs": "Disculpe, ¿dónde queda la farmacia más cercana? - ¡En la esquina de la 5ta Avenida!",
