                      "label": "Paso 3: Varios Animales (THEM) (−)",
                      "subject": "Usa THEM para referirte a grupos de animales o personas.",
                      "formula": "[ Sujeto ] + [ don't / doesn't / cannot ] + [ Verbo Base ] + [ THEM ]",
