                                                      "label": "Paso 1: Regla de Oro del Balance ⭐",
                                                      "subject": "La diferencia fundamental entre exceso negativo (Too much / Too many) y cantidad adecuada (Enough).",
                                                      "formula": "[ Too much + Incontable ] vs [ Too many + Contable Plural ] vs [ Enough + Ambos ]",
                                                      "example": "Drinking too much soda is bad, but getting enough sleep makes you feel unstoppable.",
