                      "type": "affirmative",
                      "label": "1. Defining Clauses con WHO & WHICH / THAT (Sin comas)",
                      "subject": "The student who won the award • The mobile app which transformed our school",
                      "rule": "Información esencial que especifica de quién o qué se trata.",
                      "formula": "[ Sustantivo ] + [ who / that / which ] + [ acción que lo define sin comas ]",
                      "example": "Students who dedicate thirty minutes daily to English speaking develop authentic conversational fluency.",
                      "exampleEs": "Los estudiantes que dedican treinta minutos diarios a hablar inglés desarrollan una fluidez conversacional auténtica.",
